---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const english = `${base}/en/`;
const bangla = `${base}/bn/`;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content={`0;url=${english}`} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={`https://robispider.github.io${english}`} />
    <title>Kala Layout — how Kala Jhor and Kala Goti were found</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Kala Layout</h1>
    <p>How the Kala Jhor and Kala Goti layouts were found · <span lang="bn">কালা ঝড় ও কালা গতি কীভাবে খুঁজে পাওয়া গেল।</span></p>
    <p><a href={english}>English</a> · <a href={bangla} lang="bn">বাংলা</a></p>
  </body>
</html>
